message.content:
Below is the exact request you would send to VirusTotal to retrieve the **sub‑domain** relationships for `example.org`.  
Only the object IDs and any context attributes are returned – no other fields are included.

```http
GET https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/domains/example.org/related?relationship_type=subdomains&limit=10&continuation_cursor=abc
Host: www.virustotal.com
X-Apikey: my_api
Accept: application/json
```

---

### Sample Response (JSON)

```json
{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "blog.example.org",
      "context_attributes": {
        "relationship_type": "subdomain",
        "first_seen": "2023-02-15T12:34:56Z"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "shop.example.org",
      "context_attributes": {
        "relationship_type": "subdomain",
        "first_seen": "2023-03-01T08:20:10Z"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dev.example.org",
